1
00:00:07,373 --> 00:00:15,231
I fumble for the words to say, 
My secrets burning in the dark.

2
00:00:15,996 --> 00:00:24,396
The sofa feels a mile away, 
My body frozen by a spark.

3
00:00:28,938 --> 00:00:34,035
White tiles beneath my shaking knees,

4
00:00:37,359 --> 00:00:41,919
Cold stone against a burning skin.

5
00:00:45,656 --> 00:00:50,949
Is this the only sanctuary,

6
00:00:54,250 --> 00:00:59,259
To let the heavy freedom in?

7
00:01:18,136 --> 00:01:22,221
I try to speak, 
the words fall hard,

8
00:01:22,474 --> 00:01:26,430
A heavy shame I cannot hide.

9
00:01:26,670 --> 00:01:35,319
So lead me through the quiet yard, 
Where cold white porcelain waits inside.

10
00:01:37,635 --> 00:01:41,524
Hold me tight, 
don't let me fall,

11
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:45,222
Beyond the shadow of the wall.

12
00:01:46,047 --> 00:01:50,021
You sit upon my lap so near,

13
00:01:50,379 --> 00:01:54,544
The tide begins to break the dam.

14
00:02:14,416 --> 00:02:18,292
Washing away the years of fear,

15
00:02:18,526 --> 00:02:22,228
Showing you rawly who I am.

16
00:02:22,718 --> 00:02:26,683
A sudden wave, 
a fierce release,

17
00:02:26,841 --> 00:02:31,423
For one short moment, 
I find peace.

18
00:02:33,433 --> 00:02:37,264
The sudden warmth begins to chill,

19
00:02:37,362 --> 00:02:41,424
You stand up straight, 
you turn around.

20
00:02:41,978 --> 00:02:45,689
The room goes dead, 
the air stands still,

21
00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:50,218
Your footsteps leave a hollow sound.

22
00:03:09,705 --> 00:03:13,456
The door is closing with a click,

23
00:03:14,071 --> 00:03:17,533
Leaving me naked on the brick.

24
00:03:18,236 --> 00:03:22,241
Gasping for air on the cold white floor,

25
00:03:22,414 --> 00:03:26,103
Reaching my hands through the open door.

26
00:03:28,568 --> 00:03:32,728
The mist is cold, 
the room is bare...

27
00:03:32,872 --> 00:03:36,406
Luna...

28
00:03:37,166 --> 00:03:42,437
Luna, where are you?

29
00:03:45,531 --> 00:03:48,740
Luna...

30
00:03:49,720 --> 00:03:53,249
Luna...

31
00:03:53,920 --> 00:04:00,107
Luna, where are you?

